doi: ""
preferred-citation:
  type: article
  title: "TLabel: Unified Tactile Data Annotation and Interchange for Robotic Manipulation"
  authors:
    - name: "Wu, Sheng"
    - name: "Luo, Xi"
  year: 2026
  journal: "Under review"
abstract: >
  TLabel is an open-source toolkit and format standard for tactile sensor data annotation.
  It provides sensor-agnostic data loading, unified annotation workflows, quality scoring,
  primitive prediction, and multi-format export (JSON, CSV, HDF5, FTP-1, LeRobot, RLDS, ROS2)
  across 11 tactile sensor adapters.
keywords:
  - tactile sensing
  - data annotation
  - robot manipulation
  - embodied AI
  - data format standard
